<title>USA: American Standard files 10.8 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>American Standard files 10.8 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Standard Co Inc said Friday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of up to 10.75 million American Standard shares by Kelso ASI Partners L.P.</p>
<p>Of the total, 8.6 million shares will be offered in the United States and 2.15 million will be sold in the international market, the filing said.</p>
<p>Concurrent with the offering, American Standard will repurchase 6.25 million of its shares from Kelso, up to a maximum purchase price of $300 million.</p>
</text>
